            recap = "Valennia Stormfist sent you to the head of your order. For the High Order, Elaadrin Evengale set you after Fillion Flamebreeze, a scholar you found wounded in a shriekling den; his readings from the Overlook Standing Stones were meant to steer skycutter ships between Skywall and Azeroth, so you gathered them again under the Windshapers' noses. For the Windshapers, Ayessa Dawnsinger sent you to a broken construct whose missing parts pointed to the High Order's Belathaan Brightwish, and you caught him on the road to the Shrine of Akir. Then the cult answered both orders in blood, with Belathaan's silvered tongue returned in a box and Windshaper novices dead in the highlands. Whatever they thought of each other, both orders pledged themselves to Valennia's fight.",
